      "hardware_notes": {
        "dgx_spark_gb10": "This hardware uses the community eugr/spark-vllm-b12x:latest docker image and a 2-node TP launch - the B12X backends the command relies on are not in vLLM main, so there is no pip/wheel path on Spark. Before running the generated command, check the DGX Spark cluster guide for IFACE_NAME, IB_IF and HEAD_IP."
